{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"waitUntil(mutex:endTime:)","externalID":"s:4GLib12CondProtocolPAAE9waitUntil5mutex7endTimeSbqd___s5Int64VtAA05MutexC0Rd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:4GLib7CondRefV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"waitUntil"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"MutexT"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"text":"mutex","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MutexT","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"endTime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"gint64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gint64"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GLib","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/CondRef\/waitUntil(mutex:endTime:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits until either "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cond"},{"type":"text","text":" is signalled or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"endTime"},{"type":"text","text":" has passed."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"waitUntil"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"MutexT"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"mutex"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MutexT","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"endTime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"gint64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gint64"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MutexT","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/MutexProtocol","text":"MutexProtocol","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:4GLib13MutexProtocolP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As with "},{"code":"g_cond_wait()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" it is possible that a spurious or stolen wakeup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could occur.  For that reason, waiting on a condition variable should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"always be in a loop, based on an explicitly-checked predicate.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" is returned if the condition variable was signalled (or in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"case of a spurious wakeup).  ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" is returned if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"endTime"},{"type":"text","text":" has"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"passed."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following code shows how to correctly perform a timed wait on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"condition variable (extending the example presented in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"documentation for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Cond","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"(C Language Example):"}]},{"code":["gpointer","pop_data_timed (void)","{","  gint64 end_time;","  gpointer data;","","  g_mutex_lock (&data_mutex);","","  end_time = g_get_monotonic_time () + 5 * G_TIME_SPAN_SECOND;","  while (!current_data)","    if (!g_cond_wait_until (&data_cond, &data_mutex, end_time))","      {","        \/\/ timeout has passed.","        g_mutex_unlock (&data_mutex);","        return NULL;","      }","","  \/\/ there is data for us","  data = current_data;","  current_data = NULL;","","  g_mutex_unlock (&data_mutex);","","  return data;","}"],"syntax":"C","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notice that the end time is calculated once, before entering the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"loop and reused.  This is the motivation behind the use of absolute","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time on this API – if a relative time of 5 seconds were passed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"directly to the call and a spurious wakeup occurred, the program would"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"have to start over waiting again (which would lead to a total wait"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time of more than 5 seconds)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/condref\/waituntil(mutex:endtime:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/CondRef","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/CondRef\/CondProtocol-Implementations"]]},"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/Mutex":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" struct is an opaque data structure to represent a mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(mutual exclusion). It can be used to protect data against shared","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Mutex","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Mutex","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"Mutex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/mutex"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/CondRef/CondProtocol-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/CondRef\/CondProtocol-Implementations","kind":"article","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/glib\/condref\/condprotocol-implementations","title":"CondProtocol Implementations"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/MutexProtocol":{"title":"MutexProtocol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MutexProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" struct is an opaque data structure to represent a mutex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(mutual exclusion). It can be used to protect data against shared"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"access."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/MutexProtocol","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/mutexprotocol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MutexProtocol"}]},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/CondRef/waitUntil(mutex:endTime:)":{"title":"waitUntil(mutex:endTime:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Waits until either ","type":"text"},{"code":"cond","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is signalled or ","type":"text"},{"code":"endTime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has passed.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"waitUntil"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"MutexT"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"text":"mutex","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MutexT